+
+## Knowledge persistence rollback
+
+The Knowledge boundary is an API extraction only; the `documents` table and records
+remain unchanged. If the extraction must be rolled back, restore the previous
+controller implementation (the authenticated `/documents` contract is the
+characterization test), move the Knowledge-owned files back to their ordinary Rails
+paths, and remove the Knowledge pack/dependency metadata. No data migration or
+persistence conversion is required.
